[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3480.549, "timestamp": "00:58:00", "text": "これからは毎日がイライラするだろう"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3483.35, "timestamp": "00:58:03", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "the problem is that the 2 platforms"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3484.91, "timestamp": "00:58:04", "text": "一度だけメンバーシップ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3487.27, "timestamp": "00:58:07", "text": "起こることは待って、私はそうすべきだと思いますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3491.39, "timestamp": "00:58:11", "text": "手動で追加する、待ってください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3494.069, "timestamp": "00:58:14", "text": "問題は、2 つのプラットフォーム"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3495.511, "timestamp": "00:58:15", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "the only thing is, 1 bar counting youtube supas and memberships"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3495.829, "timestamp": "00:58:15", "text": "そう、つまり、選べるのは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3499.43, "timestamp": "00:58:19", "text": "そのうちの1つですね。それで、アイデアがあります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3501.27, "timestamp": "00:58:21", "text": "チャットコマンドを作成したらどうなるでしょうか"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3501.422, "timestamp": "00:58:21", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "the other one for twitch"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3504.109, "timestamp": "00:58:24", "text": "それを自動化する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3506.39, "timestamp": "00:58:26", "text": "メンバーシップはバーが1つあるだけです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3508.87, "timestamp": "00:58:28", "text": "YouTubeのサブメンバーシップを数える"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3514.75, "timestamp": "00:58:34", "text": "のために"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3516.91, "timestamp": "00:58:36", "text": "いや、それは"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3517.671, "timestamp": "00:58:37", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and u just combine the percentages on both when they reach 100$ together"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3527.03, "timestamp": "00:58:47", "text": "問題はこれです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3529.069, "timestamp": "00:58:49", "text": "男は右に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3531.589, "timestamp": "00:58:51", "text": "進行状況は、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3533.903, "timestamp": "00:58:53", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "as in 49% on 1, 51$ on 1"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3535.19, "timestamp": "00:58:55", "text": "彼らは一緒に100ドルに達したか、私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3536.27, "timestamp": "00:58:56", "text": "それ。それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3539.27, "timestamp": "00:58:59", "text": "これは複製コピーのようなもので、"}]